{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Memoirium, everything is but sand and stars.<br><br><strong>DREAM, DEFY, DECORATE</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Peculiar Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/59f2511f4c682eafc17e997e4a56d468.poster.avif?t=1772069542\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/59f2511f4c682eafc17e997e4a56d468.webm?t=1772069542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/59f2511f4c682eafc17e997e4a56d468.mp4?t=1772069542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realm of dreams throws all reason to the wayside. In one moment, you will find yourself in a simple 21st-century school, and in the next, your eyes will fall upon a castle held together by wax.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Masks and more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/491ab99299a09811c0434a8d0fa41d0b.poster.avif?t=1772069542\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/491ab99299a09811c0434a8d0fa41d0b.webm?t=1772069542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/491ab99299a09811c0434a8d0fa41d0b.mp4?t=1772069542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most, if not every piece of equipment will alter your abilities and the entities you encounter. One set of armor influences how long negative statuses last, while a specific mask changes how enemies approach you in combat. Every item serves a purpose<strong>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Consumed now but not forever.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/b1d98c7f8f9a177bdbcbe7ba26e332c1.poster.avif?t=1772069542\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/b1d98c7f8f9a177bdbcbe7ba26e332c1.webm?t=1772069542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/b1d98c7f8f9a177bdbcbe7ba26e332c1.mp4?t=1772069542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put items to good use, as they will not disappear when consumed. Instead, items are fully replenished at certain points in your journey. Collecting the same item multiple times will upgrade it, but even equipment found in the realm of dreams has its limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/fa9b78c4829f131b49e3e33a77743ede.poster.avif?t=1772069542\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/fa9b78c4829f131b49e3e33a77743ede.webm?t=1772069542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/fa9b78c4829f131b49e3e33a77743ede.mp4?t=1772069542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There also appears to be a mysterious location that you have control of in the dream world. Decorate this area of quiet reflection using goods found throughout your journey across the realm of dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully interconnected world with multiple paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal room to decorate and write in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique dungeons with their own mobs, mini-bosses, and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 game-changing armors, masks, and off-hand items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Keepsakes (consumable items that are replenishable and provide passives)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 distinct weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >67 powerful Lullabies (spells)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3294440?t=1772069542","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3294440?t=1772069542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/7297598ef75c5ab56f4a8fd0b69d83169b9da36b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772069542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/7297598ef75c5ab56f4a8fd0b69d83169b9da36b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772069542","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Memoirium, everything is but sand and stars.<br><br><strong>DREAM, DEFY, DECORATE</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Peculiar Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: